1
00:00:00,160 --> 00:00:03,770
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)Paging Dr.
Cutie Pie!

2
00:00:06,370 --> 00:00:08,370
(Sheldon:)I must say, Amy,
I was very impressed

3
00:00:08,370 --> 00:00:11,370
(Sheldon:)to see that Bernadette got
her PhD.

4
00:00:11,380 --> 00:00:12,880
(Amy:)It's indeed admirable.

5
00:00:12,880 --> 00:00:15,710
(Amy:)Although, it is...
microbiology.

6
00:00:15,710 --> 00:00:19,180
(Sheldon:)Your doctorate is in
neurobiology.

7
00:00:19,180 --> 00:00:21,520
(Sheldon:)I fail to see the distinction.

8
00:00:21,520 --> 00:00:22,790
(Amy:)I'll make it simple for you.

9
00:00:22,790 --> 00:00:23,700
(Amy:)I study the brain,

10
00:00:23,700 --> 00:00:26,460
the organ responsible for
Beethoven's Fifth Symphony.

11
00:00:26,460 --> 00:00:27,960
(Amy:)Bernadette studies yeast,

12
00:00:27,960 --> 00:00:30,890
(Amy:)the organism responsible
for Michelob Lite.

13
00:00:32,530 --> 00:00:34,430
(Amy:)Is there something wrong
with your neck?

14
00:00:34,430 --> 00:00:36,500
(Sheldon:)It's a little stiff.

15
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:38,700
(Sheldon:)What a remarkably fragile
structure

16
00:00:38,700 --> 00:00:42,000
(Sheldon:)to support
such a valuable payload.

17
00:00:42,010 --> 00:00:47,080
(Sheldon:)Not unlike balancing a Faberge
egg on a Pixie Stick.

18
00:00:47,080 --> 00:00:48,910
(Amy:)Have you considered massage?

19
00:00:48,910 --> 00:00:51,510
(Sheldon:)I'd like to respond
to that sarcastically:

20
00:00:51,510 --> 00:00:54,610
(Sheldon:)Yes, I relish the thought
of a stranger covering my body

21
00:00:54,610 --> 00:00:57,150
(Sheldon:)with oil and rubbing it.

22
00:00:57,150 --> 00:01:01,020
(Amy:)I was proposing you massage your
muscles with your own hands.

